WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:01.060
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:01.820
We are Pongfinity

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:04.000
And today we are back with another gun game

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.820
This time we have 21 different sports equipment

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.280
And after each point

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.900
The items will get harder

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:10.760
Let's go!

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:13.500
0-0

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.060
Short spin!

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.960
I think you didn't see that coming

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.660
Okay, time for the dart board!

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.280
So close!

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.860
Oh you have a different tactique

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.120
That looked very risky!

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:01.460
No!

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.080
Two in a row!

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:03.900
Disc

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:06.280
With this racket you should be able to...

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.120
Put the shots in!

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.660
I'm not going to do the skating intro like Otto

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.080
It looked too dangerous!

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:36.280
Next up

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:39.760
Wow, not those yet

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:40.900
Cricket bat!

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.060
It was like a short put

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:53.480
I will go with this one

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:55.500
This feels like a bazooka

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.840
Yeah, this is becoming a real gun game!

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:15.500
You are never getting rid of the skateboard!

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:16.980
No, probably not!

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:19.940
I think I'll take the left-handed boxing glove

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:20.980
Let's go!

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:22.500
Okay, Rocky!

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:37.700
Just have to play safe and make Otto move

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:38.880
That's how I win

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.500
I'm going to play safe too!

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:43.600
Finally I get rid of this one!

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.220
Well, that was a K.O. (knock out)!

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.600
Are you trying to scare me with that?

00:02:58.680 --> 00:02:59.180
Yes

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:10.040
No... that was like my racket twiddling

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.380
It didn't work!

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.060
Time for some squash!

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.160
How is my squash technique?

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:28.300
Taking use of my chopping exercises

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:29.720
Yeah, that's looking good

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:31.620
Look at that footwork

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:36.320
Quite slick

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:38.600
Thanks!

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.400
I have to say I like this!

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.400
This is my favorite item so far

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.440
Time for the boomerang

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:09.140
Oh you are chopping with that also?

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:09.860
I am!

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:13.060
Apparently Emil likes to chop with everything

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:19.300
Now I'm not going to miss

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:20.640
Me neither

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.240
It's going to be a long rally

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:26.900
It's not the heaviest

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:28.500
But it's not the lightest

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:29.780
16 kg

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:31.360
I so love a good workout!

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:41.580
Yeah I can't get that one

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.380
A volleyball!

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:58.280
I knew that I would win when I got it on table!

00:04:58.320 --> 00:04:59.980
Otto rate the technique

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.560
Beginner minus minus!

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.280
Master plus plus!

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.460
Feels like I'm doing all the work here

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:18.200
I mean this is for once...

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:19.260
I'm going to win this!

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:21.740
This is how it feels to be Otto in table tennis

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:24.800
You just stand there and let the opponent do all the work!

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:25.880
Like this!

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:43.480
It hit the GoPro!

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:45.740
I think the official rules say that

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.960
"You lose the point if you hit the GoPro."

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:49.680
So I can get rid of this now

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:58.240
Boxing bag!

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.560
Maybe this is the right tactic

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.500
Surprisingly good shots

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:14.680
I was trying to hit as hard as I could but

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.020
the ball didn't really go anywhere

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:19.980
Okay, this is going to be extremely interesting!

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:26.860
So slow!

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:28.740
It looked like I didn't even try

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.740
but there was nothing you could do

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.840
It's so slow!

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:33.080
I can get rid of this

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.200
Next up is this

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:37.220
Swimming thing

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.440
Let's go!

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:41.080
What did you say Otto?

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:41.640
I said:

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:43.540
What?

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.160
"Subscribe to Pongfinity"

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:46.080
Okay, I got it!

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.600
I'm so relieved!

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:04.700
I'm not going to miss that again

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:07.120
Next up we have the yoga mat

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:26.100
I think the official rules say that:

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:29.600
"You can't have the ball on the racket for 15 seconds."

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.680
See, I found it!

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:45.640
Now it feels like normal again for me to play like this

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.420
Go on, go on!

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:48.640
Go on, go on!

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:49.420
Go on!

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:51.440
Last one!

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:52.960
One more!

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.020
Stop it!

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:57.860
Nice work Emil, you fought well!

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:00.460
Next up for me, ab roller!

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.540
I'm going to try a new tactic

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:17.660
The bike helmet

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:19.840
I think I'm going to ditch the foot tactic

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:48.200
Now I really need to think how to play with this

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.500
Good try Otto!

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:58.740
Now I go with this

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.940
He actually got one shot!

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.860
I really don't know what I was thinking there

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.200
I didn't try it that far...

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.320
But I'll take it!

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.520
You went for the hard core shot!

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:43.960
Good slingshot!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.420
Time for the ski pole

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:55.040
Good one

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:04.040
The "cmon" didn't work this time

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.340
It worked for you!

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:06.460
You took it from me!

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:07.340
Darts!

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:14.140
This is my big chance to beat the Sensei

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:16.920
Sudden death

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:24.560
And that's the game and match!

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:26.500
Thank you! Good match!

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:27.860
There's still a lot of you guys

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:29.420
who haven't subscribed to our channel

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:31.180
so help us our and do it now!

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.700
Until next time!

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:34.520
One of the hardest items

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:36.280
This is yeah

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.920
It's even way harder than the pen

